cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "promoter-motif-scanner"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free Python tool that scans promoter sequences for
  IUPAC-coded motifs on both strands, reports every hit with 1-based
  coordinates, and flags sequences where two motifs co-occur within a
  chosen distance.
type: software
authors:
